<h2 id="integration-acceptance">Integration acceptance</h2>

- Check the available, skipped, installing and rejected states with supported native test data.
- Check that opening a maintenance view or dismissing a message cannot be mistaken for a successful repair.
- Check that badge counts change without navigating, and that each repair keeps its native content and permissions.

Record the environment, versions, state, method and result with [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a simulated example do not show real device behaviour, screen reader use or live compatibility. For the wording of urgency and pending states, see [States, requests and errors](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html).
